<!doctype lake><title>教案08-指针初阶</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="e9jBd" id="e9jBd"><span data-lake-id="uea532913" id="uea532913">1.内存编址</span></h1><p data-lake-id="bcc51f6f542566967332da65800f9610" id="bcc51f6f542566967332da65800f9610"><span data-lake-id="ua0c8a904" id="ua0c8a904" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言最核心的知识之一就是指针，了解指针之前需要先了解内存编址。说起内存大家脑海里最先想到的是这个</span></p><p data-lake-id="81691c97f73dc12884e05dc5b9b0fe2d" id="81691c97f73dc12884e05dc5b9b0fe2d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560118363-3fc5c261-1522-4845-8c62-622b5822cb4c.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A155%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A830%2C%22originHeight%22%3A481%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%237a795a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B53p8%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d59c600e3985a8da4ea45bd1c77d85f5" id="d59c600e3985a8da4ea45bd1c77d85f5"><span data-lake-id="u308eb47c" id="u308eb47c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="9fe67cd2e8d63d941f94666941b3c104" id="9fe67cd2e8d63d941f94666941b3c104"><span data-lake-id="u6cce787a" id="u6cce787a" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算机的内存是一块用于存储数据的空间，由一系列连续的存储单元组成</span></p><p data-lake-id="2e7db8680932b827a19f39433af6abdf" id="2e7db8680932b827a19f39433af6abdf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560118734-6b33413e-807b-4f2c-8a1f-0db27f5ac439.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A537%2C%22height%22%3A67%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A791%2C%22originHeight%22%3A99%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5eed0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zijJn%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="c7f1bee44dce547754865a43bedbdcd2" id="c7f1bee44dce547754865a43bedbdcd2"><span data-lake-id="u076f832b" id="u076f832b" class="lake-fontsize-12">每一个单元格都表示 1 个 Bit，一个 bit 在 EE 专业的同学看来就是高低电位，而在 CS 同学看来就是 0、1 两种状态。由于 1 个 bit 只能表示两个状态，所以规定 8个 bit 为一组，命名为 byte，并且将 byte 作为内存寻址的最小单元，也就是给每个 byte 一个编号，这个编号就叫内存的地址</span></p><p data-lake-id="5e3927c1463c72335f9a00e4a8fcdac3" id="5e3927c1463c72335f9a00e4a8fcdac3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560118946-f93fec2b-82a4-4df1-8160-6001c8233b38.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A478%2C%22height%22%3A132%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A873%2C%22originHeight%22%3A241%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f6eb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HJDIi%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="4a9fd11aed037e0660da636d9fc22315" id="4a9fd11aed037e0660da636d9fc22315"><span data-lake-id="u7991eeb6" id="u7991eeb6" class="lake-fontsize-12">在计算机中，我们也要保证给每一个 byte 的编号都是唯一的，这样才能够保证每个编号都能访问到唯一确定的 byte</span></p><p data-lake-id="9664835bd80fc63353ab29859afddacd" id="9664835bd80fc63353ab29859afddacd"><span data-lake-id="u69b0175e" id="u69b0175e" class="lake-fontsize-12">所有编号连起来就叫做内存的地址空间，这和大家平时常说的电脑是 32 位还是 64 位有关，早期 Intel 8086、8088 的 CPU 就是只支持 16 位地址空间，寄存器和地址总线都是 16 位，这意味着最多对 2^16 = 64 Kb 的内存编号寻址，现在的计算机一般都是 32 位起步了，32 位意味着可寻址的内存范围是 2^32 byte = 4GB，</span><span data-lake-id="u3701bd0e" id="u3701bd0e" class="lake-fontsize-12">所以，如果你的电脑是 32 位的，那么你装超过 4G 的内存条也是无法充分利用起来的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="b4b9f604bd92f913c1038811163e8352" id="b4b9f604bd92f913c1038811163e8352"><span data-lake-id="ub3ec6643" id="ub3ec6643" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="51b3f8d89f3aed277cb09e542cad3923" id="51b3f8d89f3aed277cb09e542cad3923"><span data-lake-id="u77289ca7" id="u77289ca7" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算机中所有在使用的数据都必须放在内存中，不同类型的数据占用的字节数不一样，例如 int 占用 4 个字节，char 占用 1 个字节。为了正确地访问这些数据，必须为每个字节都编上号码，就像门牌号、身份证号一样，每个字节的编号是唯一的，根据编号可以准确地找到某个字节。</span></p><p data-lake-id="15b5af7e7eb2bd4ce8f3bd3147c66a05" id="15b5af7e7eb2bd4ce8f3bd3147c66a05" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560119181-2caa8e27-5cfd-47c6-90d8-531dedabe6a8.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A683%2C%22height%22%3A107%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A820%2C%22originHeight%22%3A128%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nwv1c%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="76cd006b77c12e186be7158d7dd20523" id="76cd006b77c12e186be7158d7dd20523"><span data-lake-id="u961bf426" id="u961bf426" class="lake-fontsize-12">像高位字节放在内存低地址的方式叫做</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7312a5a4" id="u7312a5a4" class="lake-fontsize-12">大端</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="09e098708c31f1c907b859753cc61e3d" id="09e098708c31f1c907b859753cc61e3d"><span data-lake-id="uf0acf7cf" id="uf0acf7cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">反之，将低位字节放在内存低地址的方式就叫做</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e53b1ab" id="u3e53b1ab" class="lake-fontsize-12">小端</span></strong></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%2016%20%E4%BD%8D%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%200x1234%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%A7%E7%AB%AF%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%200x00%3A%200x12%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%200x01%3A%200x34%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PaDZL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="79a78b9c3ad510920c3bbfdb6577a5a7" id="79a78b9c3ad510920c3bbfdb6577a5a7"><span data-lake-id="u6c4c82cc" id="u6c4c82cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">我们将内存中字节的编号称为地址（Address）或指针（Pointer）。地址从 0 开始依次增加，对于 32 位环境，程序能够使用的内存为 4GB，最小的地址为 0，最大的地址为 0XFFFFFFFF。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u933f2df8" id="u933f2df8"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22UjTTW%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u50e63491" id="u50e63491" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u345cb89f" id="u345cb89f"><span data-lake-id="uda70fe93" id="uda70fe93" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 高位数据：高位数据指的是二进制表示中最高有效位，也就是数字的左侧位。在一个字节（8位）中，高位数据位于最左边，决定了数值的符号或其他重要特性。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="iG7Vn" id="iG7Vn"><span data-lake-id="u94c427db" id="u94c427db">2.指针</span></h1><p data-lake-id="443d71be21fc5b6c6661c571e7bd023e" id="443d71be21fc5b6c6661c571e7bd023e"><span data-lake-id="u0e12996c" id="u0e12996c" class="lake-fontsize-12">上述提到过，定义一个变量实际就是向计算机申请了一块内存来存放，那如果我们要想知道变量到底放在哪了呢？</span></p><ul list="uc06aae7b"><li fid="uc966bf75" data-lake-id="u52b0c57c" id="u52b0c57c"><span data-lake-id="u6129bf9a" id="u6129bf9a" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以通过</span><u><span data-lake-id="u41ee45b1" id="u41ee45b1" class="lake-fontsize-12">运算符&amp;</span></u><span data-lake-id="u39db686d" id="u39db686d" class="lake-fontsize-12">来取得变量实际的地址，这个值就是变量所占内存块的起始地址</span></li><li fid="uc966bf75" data-lake-id="u032824f9" id="u032824f9"><span data-lake-id="u91a75cd8" id="u91a75cd8" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：实际上这个地址是虚拟地址，并不是真正物理内存上的地址</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20a%20%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%AF%3A%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20%26a)%3B%5Cn%5Cnchar%20c%20%3D%20'x'%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20c%20%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%AF%3A%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20%26c)%3B%5Cn%5Cndouble%20f%20%3D%201.2%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20f%20%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%AF%3A%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20%26f)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAxyf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ff55c1998df7610ce77d322971585531" id="ff55c1998df7610ce77d322971585531"><span data-lake-id="u0e1953b7" id="u0e1953b7" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="bc2453b39908ac74ec7631ebf0827481" id="bc2453b39908ac74ec7631ebf0827481" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560119367-5ed0bb7f-fc34-4ad8-ba17-56e2b90dc9f1.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A251%2C%22height%22%3A226%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A282%2C%22originHeight%22%3A254%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7eeee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iFN9S%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><ul list="ud81f4f34"><li fid="u84c09edc" data-lake-id="ufae39f6f" id="ufae39f6f"><span data-lake-id="u050440d1" id="u050440d1" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 指针变量是一个存储</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u29335930" id="u29335930">内存地址</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf8e5ab65" id="uf8e5ab65" class="lake-fontsize-12">的变量也就是指针。它的值不是直接存储数据本身，而是存储某个数据对象在内存中的地址。 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="93905cbb30554de49f05b057f2d08def" id="93905cbb30554de49f05b057f2d08def"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22WfXFD%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="uba424882" id="uba424882" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="u85a2bdbc"><li fid="uf186ab21" data-lake-id="uf6cd57d8" id="uf6cd57d8" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0d05bde4" id="u0d05bde4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">类型 *指针变量名</span></li><li fid="uf186ab21" data-lake-id="uea4130ff" id="uea4130ff" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u09191696" id="u09191696" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">解释：</span></li></ul><ul list="u85a2bdbc" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ub3d0ff9d" data-lake-id="ua804aafc" id="ua804aafc" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3eb96568" id="u3eb96568" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">“类型” ： 指针变量指向的内存空间存放的数据类型</span></li><li fid="ub3d0ff9d" data-lake-id="u59a9f6a7" id="u59a9f6a7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u21b72fa6" id="u21b72fa6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">“指向” ： 如果我保存了你的地址，那么就说我指向你</span></li><li fid="ub3d0ff9d" data-lake-id="u9238c817" id="u9238c817" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf95bdc44" id="uf95bdc44" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">“*” ：定义指针变量的固定格式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u87f0c726" id="u87f0c726"><br></p><p data-lake-id="7a7c142901e01d1fe0763d30a320190b" id="7a7c142901e01d1fe0763d30a320190b"><span data-lake-id="u3edb54ed" id="u3edb54ed" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针的声明：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20%20%20%20*p1%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%20int%20%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8Cp1%20%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%20int%20%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%A7%B0%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cnchar%20%20%20*p2%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%20char%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8Cp2%20%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%20char%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%96%E7%A7%B0%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cndouble%20*p3%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8double%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8Cp3%20%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%20double%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AZ7BK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2ee6965248faf19363b1819102d84a91" id="2ee6965248faf19363b1819102d84a91"><span data-lake-id="u2218ee2c" id="u2218ee2c" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针的赋值：赋给指针的地址，类型需跟指针的类型相匹配。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnp1%20%3D%20%26a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E7%BB%99%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88p1%5Cn%5Cnchar%20c%20%3D%20'x'%3B%5Cnp2%20%3D%20%26c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E7%BB%99%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88p2%5Cn%5Cndouble%20f%20%3D%203.14%3B%5Cnp3%20%3D%20%26f%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E7%BB%99%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88p3%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JF000%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fdemo%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%20addr%3A%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%26a)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*p%20%3D%20%26a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22p%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%3A%25p%20addr%20%3A%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp%2C%26p)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%3A%25d%20addr%20%3A%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%2C%26a)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ME6w4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2cf1ff1cf330b58d53fdbdb564509c2c" id="2cf1ff1cf330b58d53fdbdb564509c2c"><span data-lake-id="u2a240960" id="u2a240960" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针的索引：通过指针，取得其指向的目标，这个操作也被称为解引用</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22*p1%20%3D%20200%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%20p1%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3a%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BA200%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20a%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cn*p2%20%3D%20'y'%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%20p2%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3c%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BA'y'%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20c%20%3D%20'y'%3B%5Cn*p3%20%3D%206.6%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%20p3%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3f%EF%BC%89%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BA6.6%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20f%20%3D%206.6%3B%5Cn%20printf(%5C%22%25d%2C%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%2C%20*p1)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BAa%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fDgCQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f86cc3622cc4998b09f0f3ff0a491b29" id="f86cc3622cc4998b09f0f3ff0a491b29"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22x5hwx%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u12f2d8e7" id="u12f2d8e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="u0a957391"><li fid="u494bd4c7" data-lake-id="u3faf4b19" id="u3faf4b19"><span data-lake-id="u0f03c86c" id="u0f03c86c" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针尺寸只跟系统的字长有关，跟具体的指针的类型无关</span></li><li fid="u494bd4c7" data-lake-id="uaf989cf6" id="uaf989cf6"><span data-lake-id="u0d2a876f" id="u0d2a876f" class="lake-fontsize-12">在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u01ba4058" id="u01ba4058" class="lake-fontsize-12">32</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ddba5e8" id="u0ddba5e8" class="lake-fontsize-12">位系统，指针的大小占用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u62108f4b" id="u62108f4b" class="lake-fontsize-12">4</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2a6bbc8f" id="u2a6bbc8f" class="lake-fontsize-12">字节</span></li><li fid="u494bd4c7" data-lake-id="u3329bea0" id="u3329bea0"><span data-lake-id="u79c1de4e" id="u79c1de4e" class="lake-fontsize-12">在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9524a7a3" id="u9524a7a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">64</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6dcaf313" id="u6dcaf313" class="lake-fontsize-12">位系统，指针的大小占用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7982734c" id="u7982734c" class="lake-fontsize-12">8</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udaaef859" id="udaaef859" class="lake-fontsize-12">字节</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9f8e8d842f62355e4594bf1c1cc3ba6c" id="9f8e8d842f62355e4594bf1c1cc3ba6c"><span data-lake-id="u6685a2b3" id="u6685a2b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="368dff101a9bbe531d1afa75760ed4bb" id="368dff101a9bbe531d1afa75760ed4bb"><span data-lake-id="u411be662" id="u411be662" class="lake-fontsize-12">为什么需要指针？</span></p><ul list="u84b091ce"><li fid="ue2e21499" data-lake-id="u86d9a8f8" id="u86d9a8f8"><span data-lake-id="u0ecafc5a" id="u0ecafc5a" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针使得一些复杂的链接性的数据结构的构建成为可能，比如链表，链式二叉树等等</span></li><li fid="ue2e21499" data-lake-id="u93be9e3e" id="u93be9e3e"><span data-lake-id="ub3099a71" id="ub3099a71" class="lake-fontsize-12">有些操作必须使用指针。如操作申请的堆内存</span></li><li fid="ue2e21499" data-lake-id="ubb44302a" id="ubb44302a"><span data-lake-id="ue6e47290" id="ue6e47290" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中的一切函数调用中，值传递都是“按值传递”的，如果我们要在函数中修改被传递过来的对象，就必须通过这个对象的指针来完成(函数)</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="vXGHp" id="vXGHp"><span data-lake-id="ufb19f717" id="ufb19f717">3.野指针</span></h1><p data-lake-id="0ad78efec5411a54ed28992a066cdf03" id="0ad78efec5411a54ed28992a066cdf03"><span data-lake-id="ub70faaec" id="ub70faaec" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向一块未知区域的指针，被称为野指针。野指针是危险的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="99d8eb4c274a14d17d4315782ae0f9ff" id="99d8eb4c274a14d17d4315782ae0f9ff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560119586-fd3bbaa6-617a-49a0-b7a5-36ee52c793d4.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A225%2C%22originHeight%22%3A157%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DZgbO%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="c6f73484e52ad058b7060e8ed3023f8c" id="c6f73484e52ad058b7060e8ed3023f8c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4c8c179a" id="u4c8c179a" class="lake-fontsize-12">野指针 p</span></p><p data-lake-id="c9404c43a0b22e33c800920616fa612f" id="c9404c43a0b22e33c800920616fa612f"><span data-lake-id="u52ca3f92" id="u52ca3f92" class="lake-fontsize-12">危害：</span></p><ul list="u699028e5"><li fid="u1b31d11f" data-lake-id="u0fd7764b" id="u0fd7764b"><span data-lake-id="u9badcc1d" id="u9badcc1d" class="lake-fontsize-12">引用野指针，相当于访问了非法的内存，常常会导致段错误（segmentation fault）</span></li><li fid="u1b31d11f" data-lake-id="u9b330ba3" id="u9b330ba3"><span data-lake-id="ub9b08187" id="ub9b08187" class="lake-fontsize-12">引用野指针，可能会破坏系统的关键数据，导致系统崩溃等严重后果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9d0824812c664171877c2d4cfd72ff8b" id="9d0824812c664171877c2d4cfd72ff8b"><span data-lake-id="uc7ccc0ce" id="uc7ccc0ce" class="lake-fontsize-12">产生原因:</span></p><ul list="u1623f6e8"><li fid="u41046f95" data-lake-id="u8bcf8268" id="u8bcf8268"><span data-lake-id="ud36060d1" id="ud36060d1" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针变量未初始化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="3a36040bca8a3e7b8a84ac741fe5809b" id="3a36040bca8a3e7b8a84ac741fe5809b" style="text-indent: 2em; padding-left: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ud34cbf14" id="ud34cbf14" class="lake-fontsize-12">任何指针变量刚被创建时不会自动成为NULL指针，它会乱指一气。所以，指针变量在创建的同时应当被初始化，要么将指针设置为NULL，要么让它指向合法的内存。</span></p><ul list="ue37dc8cf"><li fid="u94f0b321" data-lake-id="ud751c025" id="ud751c025"><span data-lake-id="u19a2b76c" id="u19a2b76c" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针释放后未置空，所指向的内存，被系统回收</span></li><li fid="u94f0b321" data-lake-id="u79ad8d77" id="u79ad8d77"><span data-lake-id="u95b46077" id="u95b46077" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针越界</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="19a1f59adf58a82091f1262614323692" id="19a1f59adf58a82091f1262614323692"><br></p><p data-lake-id="82265b9934ce5a9c0133be74d1b85739" id="82265b9934ce5a9c0133be74d1b85739"><span data-lake-id="u35c26d48" id="u35c26d48" class="lake-fontsize-12">如何避免野指针</span></p><ul list="u75d2e85d"><li fid="ub19c764d" data-lake-id="ub4d610d0" id="ub4d610d0"><span data-lake-id="u8dfaabc3" id="u8dfaabc3" class="lake-fontsize-12">初始化时置 NULL</span></li><li fid="ub19c764d" data-lake-id="ua3857926" id="ua3857926"><span data-lake-id="u0f4ae973" id="u0f4ae973" class="lake-fontsize-12">绝不引用已被系统回收的内存</span></li><li fid="ub19c764d" data-lake-id="u5660ae83" id="u5660ae83"><span data-lake-id="u2ba02663" id="u2ba02663" class="lake-fontsize-12">确认所申请的内存边界，谨防越界</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%87%8E%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%87%8E%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%87%8E%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%98%AF%E5%8D%B1%E9%99%A9%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8D%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%88%99%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%88%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91NULL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2Fint%20*p%3B%2F%2F%20%E9%87%8E%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*p%20%3D%20NULL%3B%20%2F%2F%20NULL%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA(void%20*)0%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jzj5a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="8e7fd43a07604b372c205f34e9d6600e" id="8e7fd43a07604b372c205f34e9d6600e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560120076-465e1687-9e19-4fad-bc1c-3fe5969309d7.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A254%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A500%2C%22originHeight%22%3A500%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d0d0d0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v85Rt%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="S3rxu" id="S3rxu"><span data-lake-id="u8bd60498" id="u8bd60498">4.空指针</span></h1><p data-lake-id="74ec3c0e9c99b4cb5df5f24c66d3453a" id="74ec3c0e9c99b4cb5df5f24c66d3453a"><span data-lake-id="u405626f9" id="u405626f9" class="lake-fontsize-12">很多情况下，我们不可避免地会遇到野指针，比如刚定义的指针无法立即为其分配一块恰当的内存，又或者指针所指向的内存被释放了等等。一般的做法就是将这些危险的野指针指向一块确定的内存，比如零地址内存</span></p><p data-lake-id="6bf256293c00a79e9863bd1f6c992f08" id="6bf256293c00a79e9863bd1f6c992f08" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560120387-2f4e3088-6af6-4de7-83f1-5d5e429b5d6a.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A157%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A392%2C%22originHeight%22%3A217%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sBQ10%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="93891f3db840fc965b8a02de3fcd8bad" id="93891f3db840fc965b8a02de3fcd8bad" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u86109de7" id="u86109de7" class="lake-fontsize-12">空指针NULL</span></p><ul list="u29e1f75a"><li fid="u5d95aa30" data-lake-id="uafc3aa94" id="uafc3aa94"><span data-lake-id="u99a6cc66" id="u99a6cc66" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">概念：空指针即保存了零地址的指针，亦即指向零地址的指针。</span></li><li fid="u5d95aa30" data-lake-id="ue59740ed" id="ue59740ed"><span data-lake-id="u071b3a6a" id="u071b3a6a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">NULL地址其实就是 (void *)0,就是0</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%201%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%9A%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A9%E5%85%B6%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E9%9B%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E4%BB%A5%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%3A%5Cnchar%20*p1%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cnint%20%20*p2%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%202%EF%BC%8C%E8%A2%AB%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E4%BA%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%A9%E5%85%B6%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E9%9B%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E4%BB%A5%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%EF%BC%9A%5Cnchar%20*p3%20%3D%20(char%20*)malloc(100)%3B%20%2F%2F%20a.%20%E8%AE%A9%20p3%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%B8%80%E5%9D%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%BA100%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%5Cnfree(p3)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20b.%20%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E8%BF%99%E5%9D%97%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%20p3%20%E7%9B%B8%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%8E%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%9D%97%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%5Cnp3%20%3D%20NULL%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20c.%20%E8%AE%A9%20p3%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E9%9B%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A1rFm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="yKVtn" id="yKVtn"><span data-lake-id="u764a5655" id="u764a5655">6.指针运算</span></h1><p data-lake-id="6efeb2e9cf05e31c2f54f1e1c3c6b4d9" id="6efeb2e9cf05e31c2f54f1e1c3c6b4d9"><span data-lake-id="u8db153ff" id="u8db153ff" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针可以加上或减去一个整数。指针的这种运算的意义和通常的数值的加减运算的意义是不一样的，而是以单元为单位</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnint%20*p%20%3D%20%26a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%20p%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20a%5Cn%5Cnint%20*k1%20%3D%20p%20%2B%202%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%202%20%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%882%E4%B8%AAint%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%5Cnint%20*k2%20%3D%20p%20-%203%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%90%91%E4%B8%8B%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%203%20%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%883%E4%B8%AAint%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QnTpz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="314eb3e62e55be5c35ad7220038dc61e" id="314eb3e62e55be5c35ad7220038dc61e"><span data-lake-id="u16c9dc31" id="u16c9dc31" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="dd78f5bb453e89fb00dc3fbd1aabc3ed" id="dd78f5bb453e89fb00dc3fbd1aabc3ed" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1735560120706-f0963e65-1d2a-4c04-9eb5-030afeb7f5b1.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A554%2C%22originHeight%22%3A297%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cKE9d%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="0e5b7f1937a19a319277eb145fcacc19" id="0e5b7f1937a19a319277eb145fcacc19" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8ee90d5a" id="u8ee90d5a" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针的加减法运算</span></p><p data-lake-id="4f76bd6de5baccf121028301400fcb0f" id="4f76bd6de5baccf121028301400fcb0f"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22cKQa3%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u906844f9" id="u906844f9" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue117a626" id="ue117a626"><span data-lake-id="u1a247e8c" id="u1a247e8c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">指针的加减称为指针的偏移，</span><span data-lake-id="u5b5d1e21" id="u5b5d1e21" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">偏移的单位由</span><span data-lake-id="ud79e605b" id="ud79e605b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: inherit">指针的类型大小所决定，</span><span data-lake-id="uf4d8c0f4" id="uf4d8c0f4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">所谓指针的类型大小指的是指针变量所指向的内存空间的数据类型</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0471b5fe" id="u0471b5fe"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uce7a5330" id="uce7a5330"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22*%E5%8F%B7%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22WqV1h%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"></card><span data-lake-id="u80d532d9" id="u80d532d9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">：</span></p><ul list="ufaa6311e"><li fid="ua5d557be" data-lake-id="u873016d7" id="u873016d7"><span data-lake-id="u25c5febb" id="u25c5febb" class="lake-fontsize-12">表示乘法，例如int a = 3, b = 5, c;  c = a * b;</span></li><li fid="ua5d557be" data-lake-id="ud208b214" id="ud208b214"><span data-lake-id="u73b12d19" id="u73b12d19" class="lake-fontsize-12">表示定义一个指针变量，以和普通变量区分开，例如int a = 100;  int *p = &amp;a;</span></li><li fid="ua5d557be" data-lake-id="u0bf6ea6d" id="u0bf6ea6d"><span data-lake-id="uc2ff0097" id="uc2ff0097" class="lake-fontsize-12">表示获取指针指向的数据，是一种间接操作，例如int a, b, *p = &amp;a;  *p = 100;  b = *p;</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9626a0e4" id="u9626a0e4"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uee422de4" id="uee422de4"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22YGco6%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u647df607" id="u647df607" class="lake-fontsize-12">;</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9020154c" id="u9020154c"><span data-lake-id="uf365679b" id="uf365679b" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过指针交换两个变量的值</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22unMIm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="mGAy9" id="mGAy9"><span data-lake-id="u9aac221c" id="u9aac221c">7.问与答</span></h1><p data-lake-id="a781cc04b59f2c32826367fb2d208c2b" id="a781cc04b59f2c32826367fb2d208c2b"><span data-lake-id="u8bdff48d" id="u8bdff48d" class="lake-fontsize-12">什么是大端和小端？为什么要有大小端之分呢？</span></p><ul list="u82e38156"><li fid="u6b61cad1" data-lake-id="u232a0523" id="u232a0523"><span data-lake-id="u1d7c0231" id="u1d7c0231" class="lake-fontsize-12">所谓的大端模式，就是高位字节排放在内存的低地址端，低位字节排放在内存的高地址端。</span></li><li fid="u6b61cad1" data-lake-id="u14f1ece6" id="u14f1ece6"><span data-lake-id="ubdf74405" id="ubdf74405" class="lake-fontsize-12">所谓的小端模式，就是低位字节排放在内存的低地址端，高位字节排放在内存的高地址端。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="27549f2c8eef5a6d920cd1ed002ef1d9" id="27549f2c8eef5a6d920cd1ed002ef1d9"><span data-lake-id="u9db36050" id="u9db36050" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="6845cd9dd661c244fd72c432f8d0379c" id="6845cd9dd661c244fd72c432f8d0379c"><span data-lake-id="ue1d09c78" id="ue1d09c78" class="lake-fontsize-12">比如数字 0x12 34 56 78在内存中的表示形式为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="3fe41bf248c2c8793ca57ec39386846e" id="3fe41bf248c2c8793ca57ec39386846e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560120966-f9f92b7b-ae89-477e-9350-e7bd727f590d.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A489%2C%22height%22%3A242%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A874%2C%22originHeight%22%3A433%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rqfzP%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d957ca876e5c92a24634cca9fcae0845" id="d957ca876e5c92a24634cca9fcae0845"><span data-lake-id="u9b2fbcc0" id="u9b2fbcc0" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="o2SLP" id="o2SLP"><span data-lake-id="u054a68b7" id="u054a68b7">为什么会有大小端模式之分呢？</span></h2><p data-lake-id="770c9c3c912d1b414eb70923ea1d14cb" id="770c9c3c912d1b414eb70923ea1d14cb"><span data-lake-id="u745de7cd" id="u745de7cd" class="lake-fontsize-12">大小端模式的出现主要是由于计算机体系结构设计时对数据存储顺序的不同选择：</span></p><ul list="u8963358b"><li fid="u58be2bf8" data-lake-id="u69d0c0a8" id="u69d0c0a8"><span data-lake-id="u1075ff51" id="u1075ff51" class="lake-fontsize-12">历史发展</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="4642eca3f9066416d6e4e3532e203a8a" id="4642eca3f9066416d6e4e3532e203a8a"><span data-lake-id="uad2ff2c6" id="uad2ff2c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">不同的计算机系统和架构在设计时选择了不同的数据存储顺序。早期的计算机有不同的处理器设计，它们各自选择了最适合自己硬件的方式。</span></p><ul list="u7b28c773"><li fid="ue64429d1" data-lake-id="u41a245e0" id="u41a245e0"><span data-lake-id="ua85bf1bc" id="ua85bf1bc" class="lake-fontsize-12">人类可读性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="371f24b4eb0c009800753d069756554f" id="371f24b4eb0c009800753d069756554f"><span data-lake-id="udcd846b3" id="udcd846b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">大端模式（Big-endian）将数据的高位字节放在低地址处，这样可以让人类在查看内存时更容易理解数据。而小端模式（Little-endian）则将低位字节放在低地址处，某些运算和处理可能更高效。</span></p><ul list="u4166eaaf"><li fid="ub0269f3e" data-lake-id="u18b9a537" id="u18b9a537"><span data-lake-id="u76b03c08" id="u76b03c08" class="lake-fontsize-12">性能考虑</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3d9e360e" id="u3d9e360e"><span data-lake-id="u816c058a" id="u816c058a" class="lake-fontsize-12">在某些操作中，小端模式可以简化特定的运算，例如在处理多字节数据时，可以直接从低地址开始读取，从而减少地址计算的复杂性。</span></p><ul list="u47b3dfbd"><li fid="u7b7b6bed" data-lake-id="uf1da49fa" id="uf1da49fa"><span data-lake-id="u38bced21" id="u38bced21" class="lake-fontsize-12">兼容性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="3c93d409ef51e6c38fb7d2cdd620ef7f" id="3c93d409ef51e6c38fb7d2cdd620ef7f"><span data-lake-id="u6f4baa45" id="u6f4baa45" class="lake-fontsize-12">为了兼容不同的硬件和操作系统，许多网络协议和文件格式规定了特定的字节顺序。例如，网络协议通常使用大端模式，这要求在传输数据时进行转换。</span></p><p data-lake-id="82235c51893b7ea843d2f8715093bbc6" id="82235c51893b7ea843d2f8715093bbc6"><span data-lake-id="u124a13a6" id="u124a13a6" class="lake-fontsize-12">总之，大小端模式的不同反映了计算机设计的多样性和兼容性需求。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue7d63db8" id="ue7d63db8"><br></p><p data-lake-id="e3ea6f956b33ed8f67af20cee2e857e8" id="e3ea6f956b33ed8f67af20cee2e857e8"><span data-lake-id="u8770b431" id="u8770b431" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="088b735c59a88e223dad018bf8ff9974" id="088b735c59a88e223dad018bf8ff9974"><br></p><p data-lake-id="d6f4516726c4b2f6b73fd0af903ef761" id="d6f4516726c4b2f6b73fd0af903ef761"><span data-lake-id="u85020e48" id="u85020e48" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="096c59d52d2d6c95dcd2b5117d65df2f" id="096c59d52d2d6c95dcd2b5117d65df2f"><span data-lake-id="u23ce1d17" id="u23ce1d17" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p>